Warframe..... one of the best MMORPG's out there if not the best, I have played since the open beta (before it was released on steam) I enjoyed every minute in the game. and that are as of writing this review 25.278 minutes. I have seen a lot of content that has been addes since open beta. A few features of warframe are:
- You can parcour in the game;
- You can have a dog walk beside you;
- You can use different tactics in missions like stealth;
- You can craft DOZZENS of weapons, warframe's, sentinels etc.
- You can upgrade your gear with DOZZENS of mods;
- You can play plenty of missions;
- You can fly in space;
- You can fight different sorts of enemies
- AND
MORE
WARFRAME 10/10
A great community with devs that listen to their community and lots of content added every now and then!
If you came this far into reading my review you should already be downloading the game......

