The game is addictive but for all the wrong reasons. This is Skinnerbox in a nutshell and it exploits human psychology to its fullest. The game itself is mindless and pointless and requires human interaction only to further itself faster and faster. I have to admire people who crafted this piece as they did a perfect job. I can even write down code for this game here.
int score = 0;
int increment = 0;
While(true){
increment += human_interaction1();
score =+ increment + human_interaction2();
}
There you go. That is the game! If you are a gamer who looks for substance in your games then just simply compile this code in your head and move on. If you are someone who just want to be braindead for a while and mellow out then boy is this game for you. Since you are also the target demographic and the game admits that I have no problem recommending that game for you.
Oh and by the way to you Razer synapse users feel free to use macros for the first 3-4 days of game, Toggle loop for LMB down and LMB up and 0,001 delay. Game handles that well but don't think you can relay on this method for long. As I said this is a skinnerbox game and while yes clicking helps the benefit platoes after that time and becomes pointless.

Warframe a game where you "Tenno" masters of the Warframe have to save the solar system from the hands of the grinner, the corpus and every other baddie around (and there are alot), but killing them with style !!!
Pros:
- Amazing graphics, animations and particle effects;
- Great soundtrack (specially the 2 newer story quests, they are just a pure masterpiece);
- Random maps every mission;
- Parkour all the way through the level, or you can just walk like a peasant if you want... (yes you can do a barrel roll)  :P
- Lots of weapons to choose in your perfect style to kill enemies;
- The Devs team are always getting new updates with new content out;
- #Fashion Frame (customize everything to your own way, literally make it YOUR game!);
- The best community you will find in a game (sure there are always the random toxic players, but they are almost inexistent in this game);
-You can choose the syndicate you want to work with;
- There is no pay to win here because you are able to get everything in the game free, the currency the game uses as real money "platinum" can be traded from other players for stuff you farm in the game so you just need to find someone to trade you;
- Cinematic missions! (yes this is a free to play game with cinematics let it sink for a minute);
- If you are new and have any doubts you can always ask for help in the chat, im sure you will find someone to help you out ;)
Cons:
- Heavy grinding (I personnally like it but i know some don´t)
- PVP its not very good since there are some unbalanced powers from the warframes and some weapons can´t be used;
- Sometimes you will eventually run into a bug or two, thats just normal for a constant updating game, but be sure hotfixes burn them all away;

