I am going to say that this is a good game, I was verging on not recommending but my hours played swings me towards the other option. The issue with this game is, they release new content with no interest in what they have already released. This game now has far too many dinosaurs that are just pointless. Wildcard need to put some serious attention in to it's community management, constantly announcing timelines they can't stick to. There seem to be no official stance on dealing with dupers so the "new" servers on release won't take long before they are plagued by them either. Tribes are famous all over Youtube for Duping, and still rule some even stream doing it!
TLDR;
Good game, let down by excessive amounts of content and no real grip on toxic/cheating players.

